---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Refund Policy · Blu Baby Show" description="Our simple 7-day refund policy for Blu Shop digital products.">
  <section class="section legal">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Blu Baby Show</p>
      <h1>Refund Policy</h1>
      <p class="muted">Last updated: November 2026</p>

      <h2>Digital products</h2>
      <p>Everything in the Blu Shop is a digital download (PDF). If you are not happy with your purchase, email
        <a href="mailto:hello@blubabyshow.com">hello@blubabyshow.com</a> within <strong>7 days</strong> of buying, with your
        order email, and we will refund you in full. No long forms.</p>

      <h2>How refunds are paid</h2>
      <p>Refunds go back to the original payment method (UPI, card or wallet) through our payment partner,
        Dodo Payments, who is the merchant of record for these orders. Banks usually show the refund within 5–10 working days.</p>

      <h2>Download problems</h2>
      <p>If your download link doesn’t arrive or doesn’t work, email us and we will send the file again first.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Blu Baby Show · <a href="mailto:hello@blubabyshow.com">hello@blubabyshow.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal { padding-top: calc(var(--nav-h) + 2rem); max-width: 720px; }
  .legal h1 { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .legal h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: 2rem; color: var(--blu-deep); }
  .legal a { color: var(--blu-d); text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
